-- Description
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- SpaceFibre node: an OpenFibre port with its AMD Versal GTY adapter carries RMAP on virtual channel 0 (an OpenRMAP
-- target through an N-Char adapter) and Space Packets on virtual channel 1 (OpenSPP, directly on the channel). The
-- assignment of the channels is a convention of this example, not of the cores: any channel carries any packets, and
-- both ends of the link use the same assignment.

